  "findings": [
    {
      "finding": "Both RK3399 and S922X 43.1 board configs select Mesa Panfrost and Wayland labwc.",
      "source_keys": [
        "s922x-board",
        "rk3399-board"
      ]
    },
    {
      "finding": "Upstream RK3399 43.1 kernel remains 6.6.27; S922X donor kernel is 6.6.56. Replace donor kernel/modules with matched RK3399 kernel and complete modules; do not mix kernel module ABIs.",
      "source_keys": [
        "s922x-board",
        "rk3399-board"
      ]
    },
    {
      "finding": "43.1 ES preserves the synchronous onfinish hook followed by loadInputConfig(config); ProcessStartInfo(cmd) defaults waitForExit=true. Existing Select normalizer is compatible with this flow.",
      "source_keys": [
        "es-input-manager",
        "es-platform"
      ]
    },
    {
      "finding": "43.1 S32 Bluetooth template supports many board-specific hciattach paths. On Firefly keep rfkill unblock + BlueZ but set internal bluetoothstack empty because the DT serdev owns UART and GPIOs.",
      "source_keys": [
        "bluetooth-template"
      ]
    },
    {
      "finding": "The generic upgrade must be guarded before its cleanup trap. Default online updates should be disabled for the Firefly-specific port.",
      "source_keys": [
        "upgrade",
        "defaults"
      ]
    },
    {
      "finding": "Hardware identity batocera.arch should be rk3399 and boot/batocera.board firefly-rk3399; preserve donor 43.1 version/date text rather than relabeling v40.",
      "source_keys": [
        "system-make"
      ]
    },
    {
      "finding": "N2/S922X sysconfigs and startup writes require actual archive audit. Retain donor 43.1 compositor/GL/audio executables but remove or guard Amlogic sysfs writes, serial getty, fan service and audio defaults. Restore Firefly HDMI audio sysconfig, AP6356S WiFi/BT firmware, and adapt coldboot default controller XML."
    }
  ]
}
